Reproduce the CST HF Multilayer finite-line differential extraction — the source of the dataset's deltaL lumped, deltaC lumped, alpha_delta_val — using the Phase 1 layered-medium Green's function. Phase 2 was designed as a validation artifact: prove that the mesh, RWG basis, MPIE assembly, and S-parameter extraction are correct in a 1:1 correspondence with CST, before pivoting to the periodic formulation (Phase 3).

