## 3.1 Purpose of Phase 3

Replace the finite-line extraction (abandoned in Phase 2) with the periodic Floquet unit cell: one period of the geometry, periodic boundary conditions along z, Bloch eigenvalue extraction. From β = β_r + jβ_i, compute α, n_m, Z₀, and the per-period perturbations ΔL, ΔC. Validate against the dataset's `alpha_delta_val`, `deltaL lumped`, `deltaC lumped`.

