## 3.9 Strategic Read

The chain works. Three independent geometries produce ΔL within 4% of CST on mesh-converged runs; Z₀ composites pass at 3.9%; V3.1b passes at 1.8e-5. Getting ΔL right requires the Ewald kernel, the residue extraction, the periodic assembly, the leaky eigenvalue, and the RLGC extraction to be correct simultaneously.

